# No Cursor attribution

Never add Cursor branding or authorship to git or GitHub:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `cursoragent@cursor.com`
- Do **not** add `Made with Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or similar trailers
- Do **not** pass `--trailer` that mentions Cursor when committing
- PR bodies must not end with Cursor marketing links
- Do **not** add "Pickup prompt (paste into the other LLM)" boilerplate to handoffs or PR templates

If the environment appends attribution after your commit, amend (when amend rules allow) or strip it before the commit lands on `main`.

Run `make hooks` once per clone so `scripts/git-hooks/` strips trailers locally.
